Editorial mode is active. Send one to three public HTTP(S) URLs that should be
used as factual sources for the article. You can put all URLs in one message.

Spectre Lens will render the pages, collect readable content, and produce a
short source-grounded summary before any article is drafted. Private-network
URLs and URLs containing credentials are rejected.

You can also send a Telegram photo with a caption for the cover. Say `cancel`
(or `annulla`) at any time to discard the workflow.
